                <pb facs="0375" n="249" xml:id="pg249"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.5760c/1: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Poland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stetson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Warsaw</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-09-23T10:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                                1925—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 2 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>88. Your despatch number 110, April 21, regarding customs attachés.<anchor n="80"
                        xml:id="d184-f1"/> Foreign Office has made negative answer.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stetson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
